! mcp_bootstrap_p218.strap -- MCP printed page 218: a run of the V
! (scan) routines, V SCR3 .. V WQ, all instructions.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_001-249.pdf PDF p.225, read at 400 dpi (900 dpi for
! the doubtful glyphs).  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054C41  PUNID
! 11D11MCP  CARD ID DA000225  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 218";
! the heading row's LOCATION field is 224274, line 1's word.
!
! THE PAGE.  Contiguous from 224274.00 to 224324.40 (a half word), 50
! lines, 48 of them located; then blank paper.  Lines 22 and 33 carry
! no location and no binary: each prints only a lone "-" in the NAME
! column (and a right-hand remark number), and the counter does not
! move across them (224306.00 BZB1 full word -> 224307.00; 224313.40
! half word -> 224314.00).  They are carried as comments.
! p.217 (Vision reading, not landed) ends at 224273.40, a half word, so
! line 1's .00 continues it; p.219 (Vision) opens at 224325.00, the
! word after line 50's half word.
!
! THE TWO RIGHT-HAND COLUMNS.  Every card prints a "-NNNN" number
! (-0251 .. -0295) and a card serial DA000225 .. DA000269.  The SIC
! rows 5, 8, 23, 35, 38 print a serial but no number; the row after
! each (6, 9, 24, 36, 39) repeats that serial and prints its number
! further LEFT (-0255, -0257, -0271, -0282, -0284): SIC and the
! instruction after it are ONE card, printed as two lines.  The serial
! column is sequential with those five repeats and no gaps.  The
! serial's first glyph (and the header's CARD ID) has a straight left
! stem: D, per the C/D rule; Vision reads it C.
!
! >>> GLYPHS SETTLED BY SOMETHING OTHER THAN PLAIN INK. <<<
! * OCTAL-FIELD "C"s: the BINARY fields of rows 4, 5, 8, 10, 12, 16,
!   23, 29, 31, 35, 41 and most LOCATION fields (224274.CC ...) print C
!   (000000.CC, CCCCC0.CC, CCC033.22 ...); only 0 can stand there.
!   Checked as 0.
! * HEX "C0" FOR 00 on line 1 (NOP) and on the B rows 24, 39, 46, 49:
!   line 9 prints the SAME statement as line 24 (B,V SETX) with a clean
!   "00", B's byte is the index nibble (none printed), and NOP compiles
!   000000.30 00 on every landed page.  Checked as 00.
! * "C" FOR 0 IN THE STATEMENT on lines 13, 16, 41, 45 (LVI,V S2,C ;
!   SV,V S1,C ; V+I,V T2,C): the address field prints 000000, and no
!   symbol C exists in this program.  Written 0.
! * LINE 48'S "V L" IS V U: the index nibble prints 3 (byte 83), the
!   value V U has on rows 10, 25, 32, 43 which print a clear U; the L
!   is a U with its right stroke worn away.  No V L is referenced
!   anywhere else on the page.  Written VU.
! * O vs C IN EXTERNAL NAMES, NOT SETTLED BY INK (the bits cannot see
!   the spelling of an external): line 36 prints "V CCM", written VCOM
!   (Vision reads the definition on printed p.228 line 15 as V COM, at
!   224702.00, the word this B reaches); line 49 prints "V ECP",
!   written VECP as printed (Vision reads p.227 line 11 "V ECP" at
!   224647.40, this B's half word).  Line 47's label prints "V WEOP"
!   with the same round glyph; written VWEOP (Vision reads WECP; the
!   sibling labels p.227 "VREOP" and p.219 "WFEOP" read with O).
!   Undecided by shape either way -- recorded, not proven.
! * Q, not G, in V SQ, V SQ1, V SQ2, V WQ: at 900 dpi each has a tail
!   at lower right and no crossbar.
!
! "*" prints after the LOCATION on lines 17 and 41.
!
! EXTERNALS.  Nothing in the V routines is landed.  Every value below
! is read off THIS page's printed binary.  Corroboration, Vision
! readings only: printed p.213 lines 28-33 read V T5 SYN,$9, V T2
! SYN,$6, V S1 SYN,$10, V S2 SYN,$11; p.217 line 10 V SC7A at
! 224244.40; p.222 line 42 V NXT at 224456.40; p.227 line 45 V SETUP
! 224670.40, line 47 V SETX 224671.40; p.228 line 15 V COM 224702.00.

VS1     SYN, $10                     ! SX/LX J field 10 (lines 18, 37)
VS2     SYN, $11                     ! LV address 000033 = X11 (line 4); J 11
VT5     SYN, $9                      ! LV J field 9 (lines 4, 29)
VT2     SYN, $6                      ! LC/SV/V+I J field 6, LC address 000026
VP      SYN, $1                      ! SIC,(V P) index nibble 1 (byte 81)
VU      SYN, $3                      ! SV ..(V U) index nibble 3 (byte 33)
VH      SYN, 32                      ! p.213 line 7 "V H SYN,32", an INTEGER; ".V H" is 32 bits
VX1     SYN, (8)0.40                 ! SV,..,V X1(V U) prints 000000.55
VNXT    SYN, (8)224456.40            ! CB+ on line 6, half word only
VSC     SYN, (8)225250.0             ! LVI on lines 7, 34, half word only
VSETX   SYN, (8)224671.40            ! B on lines 9, 24, half word only
VTX     SYN, (8)225246.0             ! SX/LX lines 18, 30, 37, 40, word only
VTX1    SYN, (8)225247.0             ! SX line 19, word only
VM1     SYN(BU,64), (8)777777.0             ! CB- lines 20, 28, half word only
VNX     SYN, (8)5.0                  ! B,V NX(V U) line 32, half word only
VCOM    SYN, (8)224702.0             ! B line 36 (printed "V CCM"), half word only
VSETUP  SYN, (8)224670.40            ! B line 39, half word only
VSC7A   SYN, (8)224244.40            ! B,V SC7A+1. line 46, half word only
VPD     SYN, (8)225427.0             ! LX line 47, word only
VRCNT   SYN, (8)7.0                  ! M+1(BU,18) line 48, BIT-EXACT
VECP    SYN, (8)224647.40            ! B line 49, half word only
VWT     SYN, (8)225266.0             ! LVI line 50, half word only

        SLC, (8)224274.0
VSCR3   NOP,VSCR2                                            ! line  1
        V+ICR,VS1,15.                                        ! line  2
        CB+,VS2,VSCR6                                        ! line  3
        LV,VT5,VS2                                           ! line  4
        SIC,(VP)                                             ! line  5
        CB+,VP,VNXT                                          ! line  6
        LVI,VU,VSC                                           ! line  7
        SIC,(VP)                                             ! line  8
        B,VSETX                                              ! line  9
        SV,VT2,VX1(VU)                                       ! line 10
        BXVZ,VSCR4                                           ! line 11
        LC,VS2,VT2                                           ! line 12
        LVI,VS2,0                                            ! line 13  printed ",C"
VSCR6   SVA,,VSCR6A                                          ! line 14
        V+I,,.VH                                             ! line 15  -NORMAL RETURN SPECIFIED
VSCR6A  SV,VS1,0                                             ! line 16  printed ",C"
VSCR4   V+I,,.VH                                             ! line 17  ("*" after location) -END RETURN SPECIFIED
        SX,VS1,VTX                                           ! line 18
        SX,VS2,VTX1                                          ! line 19
        CB-,VP,VM1(VP)                                       ! line 20
VSCR2   BZB1,VSCR3.19,VSCR6                                  ! line 21
!                                                            ! line 22  prints only "-" in NAME, no location; -0270
VSC10   SIC,(VP)                                             ! line 23
        B,VSETX                                              ! line 24
        SV,VT2,VX1(VU)                                       ! line 25
        BXVZ,VSC4                                            ! line 26
        LC,VS2,VT2                                           ! line 27
VSQ2    CB-,VP,VM1(VP)                                       ! line 28
VSC4    LV,VT5,VS2                                           ! line 29
        SX,VS1,VTX                                           ! line 30
        V-I,VP,1.0                                           ! line 31
        B,VNX(VU)                                            ! line 32
!                                                            ! line 33  prints only "-" in NAME, no location; -0280
VSQ     LVI,VU,VSC                                           ! line 34
        SIC,(VP)                                             ! line 35
        B,VCOM                                               ! line 36  printed "V CCM"
        LX,VS1,VTX                                           ! line 37
        SIC,(VP)                                             ! line 38
        B,VSETUP                                             ! line 39
        SX,VS1,VTX                                           ! line 40
        V+I,VT2,0                                            ! line 41  ("*" after location) printed ",C"
        BXVZ,VSQ2                                            ! line 42
        SV,VT2,VX1(VU)                                       ! line 43
        LC,VS2,VT2                                           ! line 44
        LVI,VS2,0                                            ! line 45  printed ",C"
VSQ1    B,VSC7A+1.                                           ! line 46
VWEOP   LX,VP,VPD                                            ! line 47
        M+1(BU,18),VRCNT(VU)                                 ! line 48  printed "(V L)"
        B,VECP                                               ! line 49
VWQ     LVI,VU,VWT                                           ! line 50

!SYM VSCR3  224274.00
!SYM VSCR6  224302.40
!SYM VSCR6A 224303.40
!SYM VSCR4  224304.00
!SYM VSCR2  224306.00
!SYM VSC10  224307.00
!SYM VSQ2   224311.40
!SYM VSC4   224312.00
!SYM VSQ    224314.00
!SYM VSQ1   224322.00
!SYM VWEOP  224322.40
!SYM VWQ    224324.40
!CHECK 224274.00 | 224306.30 00 | line 1 V SCR3 NOP,V SCR2 (byte prints "C0")
!CHECK 224274.40 | 000017.25 07 | line 2 V+ICR,V S1,15.
!CHECK 224275.00 | 224302.67 48 | line 3 CB+,V S2,V SCR6
!CHECK 224275.40 | 000033.22 30 | line 4 LV,V T5,V S2
!CHECK 224276.00 | 000000.00 81 | line 5 SIC,(V P)
!CHECK 224276.40 | 224456.43 48 | line 6 CB+,V P,V NXT
!CHECK 224277.00 | 225250.07 01 | line 7 LVI,V U,V SC
!CHECK 224277.40 | 000000.00 81 | line 8 SIC,(V P)
!CHECK 224300.00 | 224671.50 00 | line 9 B,V SETX
!CHECK 224300.40 | 000000.55 33 | line 10 SV,V T2,V X1(V U)
!CHECK 224301.00 | 224304.31 42 | line 11 BXVZ,V SCR4
!CHECK 224301.40 | 000026.26 50 | line 12 LC,V S2,V T2
!CHECK 224302.00 | 000000.27 01 | line 13 LVI,V S2,C
!CHECK 224302.40 | 224303.41 D0 | line 14 V SCR6 SVA,,V SCR6A
!CHECK 224303.00 | 000000.41 05 | line 15 V+I,,.V H
!CHECK 224303.40 | 000000.25 30 | line 16 V SCR6A SV,V S1,C
!CHECK 224304.00 | 000000.41 05 | line 17 V SCR4 V+I,,.V H
